38
00:01:28.979 --> 00:01:31.459
For this tutorial, choose the terminal version.

39
00:01:31.859 --> 00:01:35.159
It fits naturally into an Ubuntu Linux environment

40
00:01:35.159 --> 00:01:37.159
alongside your scientific tools.

41
00:01:37.159 --> 00:01:41.139
You have two installation routes, use the installer

42
00:01:41.139 --> 00:01:43.579
command shown here, or install through

43
00:01:43.579 --> 00:01:45.799
a package manager such as npm.

44
00:01:46.899 --> 00:01:48.739
Prefer a graphical interface?

45
00:01:49.219 --> 00:01:52.519
The desktop app is available for Windows, Mac

46
00:01:52.519 --> 00:01:53.659
